WEBVTT

00:49.883 --> 00:52.635
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS, RELIGIONS,

00:52.719 --> 00:55.638
EVENTS, AND OCCUPATIONS
IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

01:16.951 --> 01:17.994
Mr. Kim.

01:32.383 --> 01:33.301
Mr. Jung.

01:41.559 --> 01:43.311
Does Sae-bom have the antibody?

01:43.394 --> 01:45.188
Unfortunately, she doesn't.

01:47.857 --> 01:49.818
Then why did you suddenly call me?

01:49.901 --> 01:51.361
Let Seo-yoon out.

01:51.444 --> 01:54.489
We decided to accept minors
from the lockdown areas,

01:55.073 --> 01:56.825
in terms of humanitarianism.

01:56.908 --> 01:58.535
But it's dangerous out there too.

01:58.618 --> 02:00.703
We'll keep her
in the safest place available.

02:00.787 --> 02:03.414
But the problem is coming out
of the apartment complex.

02:03.498 --> 02:06.084
Can I let Sae-bom go with her?

02:11.548 --> 02:14.467
If you two come out together,
we're willing to accept you,

02:15.176 --> 02:18.179
but you will have to cooperate
with what I'm doing.

02:20.473 --> 02:23.184
I'll discuss it with Sae-bom and call you.

02:29.440 --> 02:31.734
Do we have to keep the truth
from Mr. Jung too?

02:34.362 --> 02:35.446
Don't you find it odd?

02:37.157 --> 02:39.242
He asked if Yoon Sae-bom can go out too

02:39.325 --> 02:42.120
while saying
it's dangerous outside as well.

02:42.203 --> 02:45.165
He's someone who's willing
to come out himself if it's dangerous.

02:47.834 --> 02:49.377
What are you doing?

02:49.460 --> 02:51.754
Oh, this was at Seo-yoon's house.

02:51.838 --> 02:55.258
I was a Jenga master when I was in school.
9th degree rank in Jenga.

02:55.341 --> 02:57.260
Would you like to join us?

02:57.343 --> 03:00.346
No, I have to go to the 15th floor,
so I'll play later.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.514
Okay?

03:01.598 --> 03:02.765
You mean to Sae-bom?

03:03.349 --> 03:04.559
You saw her just now.

03:04.642 --> 03:08.229
But I miss her,
even if I see her all the time.

03:08.313 --> 03:09.647
Gross.

03:14.569 --> 03:16.237
Yi-hyun, we have trouble.

03:22.994 --> 03:23.995
What is it?

03:31.002 --> 03:31.961
This.

03:32.045 --> 03:33.296
It was on the table.

03:34.380 --> 03:37.175
I did something wrong
that cannot be undone.

03:37.967 --> 03:39.385
I tried to hold it in

03:39.469 --> 03:42.013
by staying home,

03:42.096 --> 03:44.182
but I don't think I can do that anymore.

03:44.265 --> 03:47.936
I'm going to leave the apartments
and ask for help.

03:48.019 --> 03:53.191
I'll leave the remaining food
and water for all the residents to share.

03:58.988 --> 04:00.198
Here.

04:06.246 --> 04:07.997
Don't they look different?

04:08.081 --> 04:08.957
Well…

04:09.540 --> 04:13.002
Your handwriting does change
when you're anxious.

04:16.381 --> 04:17.632
We need a detective.

04:29.602 --> 04:31.521
But can you believe it?

04:31.604 --> 04:35.149
He's going to go outside and ask for help,
but we can share the food…

04:36.567 --> 04:37.485
That's weird.

04:39.279 --> 04:41.030
What did he mean by a wrongdoing

04:42.365 --> 04:43.324
that can't be undone?

04:45.034 --> 04:48.705
What can he do
when he doesn't leave his house?

04:50.498 --> 04:51.708
Well, there is something.

04:52.542 --> 04:53.459
The gym.

04:53.543 --> 04:55.128
You're still thinking about that?

04:55.211 --> 04:57.255
I told you, he's not someone
who'd take drugs.

04:58.423 --> 04:59.299
What is this?

05:00.258 --> 05:01.592
WHITE LIMESTONE

05:01.676 --> 05:03.803
Does he grow a vegetable garden, too?

05:03.886 --> 05:06.431
If you put it in the toilet,
it blocks the odor.

05:08.182 --> 05:09.642
I'm in the SOU, you know.

05:11.936 --> 05:14.772
- I used it during outdoor drills.
- Right.

05:20.737 --> 05:22.238
What's going on?

05:29.954 --> 05:31.706
He does have a lot of medicine.

05:35.084 --> 05:36.753
But these drugs are all authorized.

05:43.551 --> 05:45.261
It's Next.

05:47.013 --> 05:49.223
- Seriously, this place is…
- What?

05:49.307 --> 05:51.059
What the heck? You two were in there.

05:51.142 --> 05:53.352
- What's the house owner doing?
- Why are you here?

05:53.436 --> 05:55.521
We're here to finish
yesterday's conversation.

05:55.605 --> 05:57.148
We're all struggling now, so…

05:59.734 --> 06:02.028
- You received something.
- This is…

06:02.111 --> 06:04.989
We live in the same building,
so we should help each other.

06:06.866 --> 06:08.701
We're talking to him,

06:10.203 --> 06:11.579
so please wait.

06:30.098 --> 06:32.809
There's no sign of trespassing,
but we found Next.

06:32.892 --> 06:36.562
"Something that cannot be undone."
Maybe that means he's infected.

06:39.023 --> 06:40.399
I don't know.

06:41.400 --> 06:44.028
He takes selfies and he's always happy.

06:44.779 --> 06:46.781
Even if he was infected,
he'd just stay home.

06:47.406 --> 06:52.328
There's no way
that homebody would've gone outside.

06:52.912 --> 06:54.372
Then where would he be?

06:54.455 --> 06:55.289
Someone…

06:56.457 --> 06:57.583
must've locked him up.

06:59.127 --> 07:00.586
What about his note, then?

07:00.670 --> 07:03.005
He wrote that because he was threatened.

07:12.557 --> 07:13.683
Or maybe not.

07:31.534 --> 07:34.495
He's not in the building,
and the lobby door is unlocked.

07:34.579 --> 07:36.080
He might've really gone outside.

07:36.164 --> 07:38.166
But there are soldiers everywhere outside.

07:38.249 --> 07:41.169
He's rich. He might have paid someone
to unlock the door for him.

07:43.629 --> 07:46.132
Come on, open the door, please!

07:47.550 --> 07:48.384
Sir!

07:49.051 --> 07:50.887
I don't hear anything. Are you in there?

07:50.970 --> 07:52.388
What are you doing?

08:01.647 --> 08:03.316
You're here too.

08:04.150 --> 08:07.778
Everyone asked me for help.

08:09.405 --> 08:11.449
I heard he has a lot of water,

08:11.532 --> 08:13.701
so wouldn't it be nice to share some?

08:13.784 --> 08:15.411
I know, right?

08:15.495 --> 08:18.080
So we just want to talk to him.

08:19.081 --> 08:22.210
Someone saw him going outside too,

08:22.293 --> 08:24.212
so we must check if he's infected as well.

08:24.795 --> 08:26.631
- Who saw him?
- Me.

08:27.298 --> 08:29.467
I saw him going out early in the morning.

08:29.550 --> 08:30.384
Really?

08:30.927 --> 08:32.595
Are you sure it was Kim Se-hoon?

08:32.678 --> 08:34.472
I couldn't see his face,

08:34.555 --> 08:37.600
but he's the only person
who wears a quarantine suit.

08:45.233 --> 08:46.901
I'm sorry,

08:46.984 --> 08:50.071
but we do need a plan
because we're short on water.

08:52.865 --> 08:55.952
And the people on the 2nd floor
put a ridiculous price on it.

08:56.702 --> 08:57.578
Gosh.

09:13.886 --> 09:15.179
So you had the key too.

09:15.263 --> 09:17.848
They even brought out
a shopping bag with something in it!

09:17.932 --> 09:19.308
It's mine, okay?

09:23.563 --> 09:24.522
Oh, my goodness.

09:29.735 --> 09:32.238
He said to share the things in his house.

09:32.321 --> 09:34.282
So the house owner gave permission.

09:34.365 --> 09:36.242
Then why didn't you say anything earlier?

09:36.325 --> 09:40.037
More than that,
what's "something that cannot be undone?"

09:41.831 --> 09:44.083
Did he have legal problems?

09:44.166 --> 09:46.168
Anyway, it's a finders-keepers situation.

09:46.669 --> 09:48.337
Honey, take this water first.

09:48.421 --> 09:49.255
Take it.

09:52.216 --> 09:54.594
- Let go.
- Please calm down.

09:54.677 --> 09:56.596
Let's share some of the food first.

09:56.679 --> 09:58.347
Not all of them. Just some of them.

09:58.431 --> 10:00.016
We don't know when he'll be back.

10:00.099 --> 10:02.351
And leave some for those who aren't here.

10:02.435 --> 10:04.478
Who are you to decide that?

10:06.355 --> 10:09.233
All right!
Call the others! Tell them to come!

10:09.317 --> 10:10.985
Detective, look at this!

10:11.068 --> 10:12.361
Call everyone!

10:12.445 --> 10:14.780
I said, call them! I got it!
Let me go! Come on!

10:21.662 --> 10:22.913
It's heavy.

10:22.997 --> 10:24.707
I'm glad we got water.

10:26.500 --> 10:28.502
Let's turn this light on
in the bathroom too.

10:31.464 --> 10:32.965
What are you so displeased about?

10:33.549 --> 10:36.010
Hey, we only got this much.

10:36.093 --> 10:39.055
That place had lots
of survival equipment too.

10:39.847 --> 10:43.184
Still, the detective
on the 5th floor divided it fairly.

10:43.267 --> 10:45.061
Hey, did you say "fair?"

10:45.144 --> 10:48.898
If he really wanted to be fair,
he should've given us more!

10:48.981 --> 10:51.734
Those who paid more
to get in here should get more stuff!

10:51.817 --> 10:53.277
Isn't that common sense?

10:54.070 --> 10:55.488
You're talking nonsense.

10:55.571 --> 10:57.698
Right. That's true.

10:58.866 --> 11:02.286
By the way, that guy on the 5th floor…
Wasn't he weird today?

11:02.370 --> 11:04.622
He was stuck to his wife's side like glue.

11:05.998 --> 11:08.000
I guess he loves her very much.

11:12.296 --> 11:15.716
You love me very much too, right?

11:15.800 --> 11:17.885
Hey, it's hot. Get off me.

11:18.761 --> 11:21.347
But there was a lot of food there, right?

11:22.932 --> 11:24.183
Yes.

11:24.266 --> 11:27.978
The house was big,
and it had a lot of weird things too.

11:46.497 --> 11:47.706
What are you looking at?

11:49.500 --> 11:51.043
What brings you two here?

11:51.127 --> 11:52.586
It's about Unit 1501.

11:52.670 --> 11:55.798
The owner left all his stuff behind.
It's a waste to leave them there.

11:55.881 --> 11:59.593
The residents are suffering
from a shortage of necessities.

12:02.596 --> 12:04.181
Hey, leave us.

12:05.641 --> 12:06.976
Are you telling me to go out?

12:07.059 --> 12:08.519
Then should I go out?

12:09.103 --> 12:10.312
Stay outside.

12:14.859 --> 12:16.026
Hurry!

12:17.278 --> 12:18.362
Come in.

12:30.416 --> 12:33.294
So Kim Se-hoon went outside, right?

12:33.377 --> 12:34.795
I think so.

12:34.879 --> 12:36.922
He's not in the building. That's for sure.

12:37.006 --> 12:38.299
He must've been lonely.

12:38.382 --> 12:41.385
I saw it on TV.
There's this thing called solitary death.

12:41.469 --> 12:44.138
He has neither family nor friends,

12:44.221 --> 12:46.056
so that must be why he went outside.

12:47.308 --> 12:50.561
My mom and dad are together,
so they'd be okay, right?

12:52.354 --> 12:53.189
Of course.

12:53.981 --> 12:57.193
We would've been lonely too
if we didn't have you, Seo-yoon.

12:57.276 --> 12:58.652
Your cute dimple!

13:07.203 --> 13:08.287
Thanks.

13:12.958 --> 13:14.126
Isn't it spicy?

13:15.252 --> 13:17.505
You're good
at eating spicy food, Seo-yoon.

13:21.759 --> 13:23.552
You dipped that much?

13:24.094 --> 13:25.012
Isn't it spicy?

13:25.095 --> 13:26.388
It's okay.

13:26.472 --> 13:28.140
It looks spicy.

15:12.119 --> 15:13.287
Mr. Kim.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.457
Mr. Kim.

15:17.291 --> 15:19.168
What?

15:20.836 --> 15:23.714
Yi-hyun isn't here.
When did he go outside?

15:24.548 --> 15:26.216
I don't know.

15:27.134 --> 15:29.887
Do you miss him
even if you see him all the time?

15:31.764 --> 15:32.806
Go back to sleep.

15:33.432 --> 15:36.185
I've been there, so I know.

16:05.589 --> 16:07.257
Will you marry me?

16:07.341 --> 16:09.802
I wanted to have herringbone flooring,

16:09.885 --> 16:12.596
but it's new flooring,
so I can't rip it out.

16:13.097 --> 16:14.974
Still, this is neat.

16:15.975 --> 16:17.601
I can't believe this.

16:18.185 --> 16:19.353
I have a house now.

16:24.108 --> 16:25.943
I thought I was left alone.

17:00.227 --> 17:01.478
Hey.

17:01.562 --> 17:03.647
Where have you been?
Why aren't you sleeping?

17:07.860 --> 17:10.195
- Well…
- Does the walkie-talkie work?

17:11.488 --> 17:12.740
Give it to me.

17:15.159 --> 17:16.702
Lieutenant Colonel Han Tae-seok.

17:20.330 --> 17:21.540
Lieutenant Colonel Han.

17:24.877 --> 17:25.753
Hey, Han Tae-seok!

17:25.836 --> 17:27.588
I'm sure he's asleep.

17:29.590 --> 17:30.799
What did he say?

17:33.135 --> 17:34.386
Do I have the antibody?

17:38.223 --> 17:39.099
You don't.

17:40.476 --> 17:41.727
I knew it.

17:42.352 --> 17:45.189
I've never even gotten 5th in the lottery.

17:47.149 --> 17:49.735
Still, I'm glad that I didn't get
the disease at least.

17:53.864 --> 17:56.658
Hey, did your wound open?

17:57.242 --> 17:59.078
No, it got much better.

17:59.161 --> 18:01.413
No, it didn't.
It'll be awful if it gets infected.

18:01.497 --> 18:02.498
I…

18:24.895 --> 18:26.897
It does look much better, but…

18:27.648 --> 18:31.110
I told you. I'm a human vitamin
and a human antibiotic.

18:31.693 --> 18:33.612
You don't have additional injuries, right?

18:33.695 --> 18:35.114
If you do, tell me. Okay?

18:35.197 --> 18:36.573
Okay.

18:36.657 --> 18:37.866
Good.

18:39.451 --> 18:40.994
What did Han Tae-seok say?

18:42.287 --> 18:43.705
He told us to let Seo-yoon out.

18:43.789 --> 18:45.874
He said they'll take her in.

18:45.958 --> 18:47.376
- Really?
- Yes.

18:47.459 --> 18:48.293
So?

18:48.877 --> 18:50.963
I told him I'll discuss it with you.

18:54.675 --> 18:56.385
Wouldn't it be dangerous outside?

18:57.302 --> 18:58.804
So I was thinking…

18:59.346 --> 19:01.140
Why don't you go outside with her?

19:01.765 --> 19:04.476
If you're with Seo-yoon,
I'm sure she'll feel relieved too.

19:05.435 --> 19:07.271
We should all go out together.

19:07.354 --> 19:09.189
And you should get some antibiotics too.

19:10.732 --> 19:11.567
I think…

19:12.860 --> 19:15.154
it's better for Seo-yoon
not to go outside for now.

19:15.821 --> 19:18.157
We need to know
what it's really like out there.

19:21.577 --> 19:22.744
Right.

19:23.912 --> 19:26.748
Is Kim Se-hoon outside?

19:26.832 --> 19:28.083
Not officially,

19:28.917 --> 19:31.920
but he said he'll look into it
since someone could've helped him.

19:32.004 --> 19:33.714
I thought about it, and…

19:36.800 --> 19:38.218
He may be in here.

19:39.178 --> 19:41.138
But we checked everywhere in the building.

19:42.264 --> 19:44.099
There's one place we didn't check.

19:48.645 --> 19:51.982
He tried to go outside,
but he got scared of soldiers

19:52.065 --> 19:53.984
and the infected, so he came back in.

19:54.610 --> 19:56.236
He's hiding in here now.

19:57.070 --> 19:59.364
I'm sure he doesn't know
the passcode, though.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.700
Still, we have to check.

20:20.427 --> 20:21.345
Sae-bom.

20:23.597 --> 20:25.724
KIM SE-HOON, UNIT 1501

20:47.496 --> 20:48.914
Did you enjoy it?

20:50.707 --> 20:52.167
Of course, I did.

20:57.965 --> 20:59.049
You two.

20:59.883 --> 21:01.009
Stop it and come out.

21:12.771 --> 21:15.899
You just need to keep that in mind.

21:16.566 --> 21:18.402
I was giving some legal consultation.

21:21.780 --> 21:24.574
Don't do that in places
where there are no people.

21:24.658 --> 21:26.159
Legal consultation.

21:26.952 --> 21:29.913
You may run into the infected
if you wander around secretly.

21:29.997 --> 21:31.707
Will you keep this a secret?

21:33.333 --> 21:35.210
Mr. Lawyer, you should tell the truth.

21:36.003 --> 21:37.212
Once trust is broken,

21:37.296 --> 21:38.839
your relationship can't last long.

21:40.590 --> 21:41.842
Can we go now?

21:43.677 --> 21:44.928
You two.

21:46.054 --> 21:47.848
Don't ever come here again.

21:51.476 --> 21:52.769
Wait.

21:52.853 --> 21:54.521
Don't forget to take this.

21:57.733 --> 21:59.484
That's not ours.

22:20.464 --> 22:21.757
Mr. Kim.

22:32.225 --> 22:33.310
Mr. Kim?

22:35.103 --> 22:36.313
Can you hear me?

22:40.734 --> 22:44.279
Are you doing this
because you feel thirsty?

23:24.194 --> 23:26.071
- This powder…
- It's limestone.

23:27.864 --> 23:29.616
It was at Kim Se-hoon's house.

23:53.974 --> 23:54.808
Mr. Oh.

23:55.642 --> 23:57.227
You're a real doctor, right?

23:59.229 --> 24:01.356
Come out. You need to take
a look at someone.

24:03.024 --> 24:04.442
But my license got suspended.

24:06.111 --> 24:09.114
Who is it? Who's sick?

24:11.533 --> 24:13.201
You'll know once you come.

24:13.285 --> 24:15.453
We know nothing. We're serious.

24:15.537 --> 24:18.874
We were just having a legal consultation.

24:18.957 --> 24:21.084
You don't need to talk about that anymore.

24:21.168 --> 24:23.879
Just tell us about
the situation when you got in here.

24:23.962 --> 24:25.589
Didn't you feel anything strange?

24:27.424 --> 24:29.759
Well, I don't remember.

24:30.552 --> 24:32.304
Didn't you go into the master bedroom?

25:06.004 --> 25:08.715
We did go in there, but…

25:08.798 --> 25:10.175
You see…

25:10.258 --> 25:13.011
It smelled like cement,
and flies were buzzing in there,

25:13.094 --> 25:14.387
so we stepped out.

25:15.472 --> 25:18.308
If we knew there was a corpse,
we wouldn't have stayed here.

25:18.391 --> 25:21.144
You're not suspecting us, are you?

25:21.228 --> 25:25.315
I'm a lawyer. Please keep in mind
that I'm not that stupid.

25:28.235 --> 25:29.194
What about Jung-kook?

25:29.277 --> 25:31.571
I told him what happened.
He'll bring people.

25:34.491 --> 25:36.117
What are you doing here?

25:37.702 --> 25:38.536
This way.

25:39.496 --> 25:40.789
Wait here for a moment.

25:56.179 --> 25:57.764
DO NOT ENTER, RISK OF INFECTION!

26:01.184 --> 26:02.560
What are you looking at?

26:06.856 --> 26:09.025
Whenever I see this,
I feel a bit more relaxed.

26:10.527 --> 26:13.405
I can't be a shameful father to my kids.

26:16.616 --> 26:19.369
I only looked at this,
but the battery's running out.

26:26.209 --> 26:27.210
Here.

26:27.294 --> 26:31.339
Hey, don't you need this
to write your novel?

26:32.424 --> 26:34.551
I have paper and a pencil.

26:35.844 --> 26:39.764
That's what's good about being a writer.
It doesn't cost money.

26:39.848 --> 26:41.224
Thanks.

26:43.768 --> 26:46.146
All I do is receive stuff from you.

26:47.605 --> 26:50.567
I'm so ashamed as your older brother.

26:52.527 --> 26:53.903
Hyun-kyung, even so…

26:55.238 --> 26:57.198
if something bad happens to me,

26:58.450 --> 27:01.453
then please look after my family.

27:02.704 --> 27:04.164
No way.

27:05.415 --> 27:07.375
Just think of getting out of here safely.

27:07.459 --> 27:10.295
Hey, you know I'm ill.

27:10.378 --> 27:12.547
I'm begging you, so please…

27:12.630 --> 27:15.508
You seem much better now.

27:19.846 --> 27:20.930
Hi.

27:21.848 --> 27:22.682
Hi.

27:24.559 --> 27:27.937
You gave us food last time.
I'm repaying you for that.

27:33.109 --> 27:34.486
What? What's all this?

27:36.654 --> 27:37.781
What?

27:41.534 --> 27:43.870
By the way, is it okay
to give us all this?

27:43.953 --> 27:46.414
Of course. It's all mine.

27:49.209 --> 27:51.127
You two were here.

27:52.962 --> 27:53.797
Well…

27:54.422 --> 27:56.466
You should come with me to the 11th floor.

27:56.549 --> 27:58.093
Why? What happened?

27:58.676 --> 28:00.053
You see…

28:01.262 --> 28:02.597
Someone died.

28:02.680 --> 28:04.599
What? Who?

28:10.063 --> 28:13.191
Why would you do this to me
when I've just woken up?

28:13.274 --> 28:15.527
That really scared me. Jeez.

28:15.610 --> 28:17.862
But you're the only doctor
in this building.

28:17.946 --> 28:20.365
Then you should've told me
what was in there.

28:21.908 --> 28:22.826
Wait.

28:22.909 --> 28:24.953
What? Did you suspect me?

28:25.036 --> 28:29.249
Did you make me go into that room
because you thought I killed her?

28:29.332 --> 28:30.959
That doesn't seem to be the case.

28:31.042 --> 28:32.544
Well, you're so good at lying.

28:32.627 --> 28:34.295
You think I'm a murderer?

28:34.379 --> 28:35.672
Forget it.

28:35.755 --> 28:36.881
Just tell us

28:37.841 --> 28:39.217
your opinion as a doctor.

28:39.801 --> 28:41.553
She was obviously bitten to death.

28:42.178 --> 28:43.680
Her neck was completely torn.

28:43.763 --> 28:45.014
It stinks.

28:45.098 --> 28:47.517
Can't you tell us something
more professional?

28:49.269 --> 28:50.353
Professional?

28:51.229 --> 28:53.940
Judging by the blood coagulation
and rigidity of the body,

28:54.023 --> 28:55.692
it's been more than two days
since she died.

28:56.818 --> 28:59.320
The killer tried to get rid
of the smell with limestone.

28:59.404 --> 29:02.490
It's that limestone
from the 15th floor, right?

29:02.574 --> 29:05.368
Damn it. These flies…

29:06.536 --> 29:08.997
These things come first when a human dies.

29:09.080 --> 29:12.250
They lay eggs in their eyes and nose.

29:12.333 --> 29:16.838
This is why it's better to be alive
even if your life's a mess.

29:16.921 --> 29:19.090
Go out there and explain it to the people.

29:19.174 --> 29:20.633
And don't talk about the flies.

29:22.260 --> 29:24.846
That scared the crap out of me. Darn it.

29:24.929 --> 29:29.976
By the way, did those two
find the body first?

29:30.059 --> 29:31.186
Together?

29:31.269 --> 29:32.395
It's a misunderstanding.

29:32.479 --> 29:36.691
I felt weird, so I asked him to come here.

29:37.442 --> 29:40.111
Because the cleaning lady
was crying in my dreams…

29:41.237 --> 29:43.907
- I mean it.
- Right. Of course.

29:43.990 --> 29:45.158
Don't.

29:45.241 --> 29:46.367
It's okay.

29:48.286 --> 29:51.247
I'm really okay,
but I'm worried about the lawyer.

29:51.331 --> 29:55.251
Your wife will be really shocked,
won't she?

29:56.961 --> 29:59.589
That superpower jerk
stabbed us in the back!

30:01.758 --> 30:05.678
Detective, Andrew took our food
and ran away!

30:05.762 --> 30:07.096
He's been caught in the act!

30:07.180 --> 30:09.182
Don't you have to arrest him right away?

30:09.265 --> 30:11.142
Please calm down.

30:11.226 --> 30:12.727
Someone died.

30:12.811 --> 30:14.771
That's not important right now.

30:14.854 --> 30:16.523
The food is gone!

30:16.606 --> 30:19.275
The cleaning lady
who was at your house died!

30:19.359 --> 30:20.985
Ms. Lee Deok-soon!

30:21.569 --> 30:22.654
What…

30:22.737 --> 30:23.988
Seriously.

30:24.823 --> 30:27.534
I checked the body,

30:27.617 --> 30:29.786
and it looks like the infected did it.

30:29.869 --> 30:31.871
Her neck was bitten.

30:34.666 --> 30:36.501
It must be the man on the 15th floor.

30:36.584 --> 30:38.002
It was written on the note.

30:38.086 --> 30:40.547
"Something wrong that cannot be undone."

30:42.841 --> 30:43.925
Right.

30:44.926 --> 30:46.302
That was a confession.

30:46.386 --> 30:49.931
That means we can share
the remaining food, right?

30:50.014 --> 30:53.726
We don't have evidence saying
that Kim Se-hoon did it.

30:53.810 --> 30:55.687
Who else can it be, then?

30:56.437 --> 30:58.565
There aren't
any other infected people here.

30:58.648 --> 31:00.483
Now, when you take a look at it…

31:00.567 --> 31:04.195
If there's a victim and a runaway,
we naturally know who the culprit is.

31:04.279 --> 31:07.073
Mr. Jung, you're a detective,
so you'd know, right?

31:10.660 --> 31:12.495
We need to investigate more.

31:13.162 --> 31:16.457
Especially about how the victim left
the second floor and was found here.

31:18.668 --> 31:21.254
We will hear more from you two
as the witnesses later.

31:29.637 --> 31:30.471
Honey.

31:32.307 --> 31:34.100
The corpse was really scary.

31:37.353 --> 31:41.149
Unit 1102 is a crime scene,
so no one's allowed in there.

31:41.232 --> 31:43.735
We changed the passcode too.
So keep that in mind.

31:43.818 --> 31:45.486
When will you give out the food?

31:45.570 --> 31:47.614
That bastard Andrew
took ours and ran away!

31:49.073 --> 31:50.283
Sae-bom, Yi-hyun.

31:50.366 --> 31:52.869
Mr. Ahn and the writer are here.

31:53.494 --> 31:54.579
It's so damn far away.

31:54.662 --> 31:58.541
- What happened?
- Did the cleaning lady really pass away?

31:58.625 --> 32:00.084
You damn thief!

32:00.168 --> 32:01.836
How could you do this?

32:02.545 --> 32:04.464
- Stop it.
- Let go! You jerk!

32:04.547 --> 32:06.299
Honey, are you trying to kill him?

32:06.382 --> 32:09.010
What's wrong with you?

32:09.093 --> 32:10.386
Are you okay?

32:15.975 --> 32:17.560
Hey!

32:22.607 --> 32:23.691
Young-in.

32:25.985 --> 32:27.153
Young-in.

32:27.695 --> 32:29.447
The symptoms won't stop.

32:30.031 --> 32:32.825
- What about the tranquilizer?
- We injected the maximum amount.

32:32.909 --> 32:34.827
Her body won't be able
to hold out anymore.

32:36.621 --> 32:39.123
Do we have samples
of the plasma cure we made?

32:39.707 --> 32:41.751
There's one,
but the higher-ups are taking it.

32:41.834 --> 32:44.128
They told us to submit everything
being tested.

32:44.796 --> 32:45.964
Lieutenant Colonel.

32:52.303 --> 32:55.390
Didn't you say you'll keep it
a secret from Ms. Yoon?

32:55.473 --> 32:56.766
If we take the cure now,

32:56.849 --> 32:58.768
the higher-ups will notice it's important.

32:58.851 --> 32:59.936
I know that.

33:18.246 --> 33:19.288
Leave it here.

33:25.962 --> 33:27.088
Lower your gun.

33:28.881 --> 33:30.049
Lower your gun!

33:40.059 --> 33:41.477
Please calm down.

33:41.561 --> 33:42.937
We're all on the same side,

33:43.688 --> 33:46.107
and Lieutenant Colonel
Han Tae-seok is in charge here.

33:47.567 --> 33:49.027
Ask the Prime Minister's office.

33:50.236 --> 33:51.696
He's doing what he needs to do.

34:05.460 --> 34:06.711
Get out of the way.

35:18.950 --> 35:19.992
Check her condition,

35:20.076 --> 35:21.994
and report right away
if there's a problem.

35:22.745 --> 35:24.205
What happened just now…

35:25.998 --> 35:28.084
The higher-ups will find out.

35:29.377 --> 35:31.879
Also, that you kept it
a secret from Ms. Yoon.

35:31.963 --> 35:33.881
We just need to report it first.

35:34.465 --> 35:36.342
- What?
- Report to the higher-ups

35:36.425 --> 35:37.635
that she has the antibody.

35:37.718 --> 35:40.930
And that we confirmed it
by testing it on my wife's body.

35:41.013 --> 35:42.306
Then…

35:42.390 --> 35:44.517
Tell them I'll take
Yoon Sae-bom out tomorrow.

35:45.101 --> 35:47.019
It will only buy some time.

35:47.103 --> 35:48.813
They will suspect you.

35:50.231 --> 35:51.649
That's what I need.

35:53.109 --> 35:54.110
Time.

35:58.739 --> 36:00.658
Andrew is the last witness.

36:00.741 --> 36:02.201
No one else saw her after him.

36:03.077 --> 36:05.746
So the estimated time of death
is around that time too?

36:07.331 --> 36:10.001
It means she was killed
on her way upstairs.

36:11.169 --> 36:12.003
But…

36:12.545 --> 36:14.463
Do you think Kim Se-hoon really did this?

36:17.049 --> 36:19.260
Sae-bom, give me some water.

36:20.261 --> 36:21.137
I'm thirsty.

36:22.388 --> 36:25.057
Gosh, I'm so tired.

36:25.766 --> 36:27.602
I'm getting a lot of exercise here.

36:28.603 --> 36:30.062
I'm thirsty.

36:35.067 --> 36:36.736
I'm so thirsty. Thanks.

36:44.952 --> 36:46.495
Where are the other residents?

36:46.579 --> 36:50.041
They're asking why we're doing nothing
when it's obvious who the killer is.

36:50.124 --> 36:52.168
They said we should
just break into Unit 1501

36:52.251 --> 36:54.629
and share the rest of the things in there.

36:59.800 --> 37:02.303
Let's go. If we do nothing,
they'll get more agitated.

37:03.763 --> 37:05.264
But I just sat down…

37:14.982 --> 37:18.903
We're only sharing the food.
You can't take anything else.

37:18.986 --> 37:21.948
And we'll leave some, just in case.

37:22.031 --> 37:24.659
We'll give them out to each of you,
so come in one by one.

37:25.952 --> 37:27.119
Come in.

37:30.248 --> 37:32.250
They said everyone gets a portion.

37:32.333 --> 37:35.628
- Shouldn't we get Andrew's portion?
- We can just take it.

37:35.711 --> 37:38.297
We take Andrew's portion too, right?

37:38.381 --> 37:39.423
We can take it.

37:40.466 --> 37:43.761
But shouldn't they give
Andrew's portion to us?

37:43.844 --> 37:46.806
Why didn't they give it to us?
He took so much!

37:46.889 --> 37:49.225
I won't let this slide. Just wait and see.

37:49.308 --> 37:53.062
Gosh, how could he
take everything like that?

38:37.106 --> 38:39.150
Is Dong-hyun here?

38:39.233 --> 38:40.318
What?

38:42.653 --> 38:45.239
He was here, but he left.

38:46.574 --> 38:49.327
I carried all this heavy stuff by myself.

38:49.410 --> 38:50.828
Seriously…

38:53.164 --> 38:54.415
So-yoon…

38:55.374 --> 38:58.252
I really was just giving
that woman legal consultation

38:58.336 --> 39:00.838
in a quiet place…

39:03.716 --> 39:04.633
Stop it.

39:06.177 --> 39:07.636
I'm sick of hearing that.

39:16.395 --> 39:18.064
Can I really stay here?

39:18.147 --> 39:19.648
Only for a while.

39:19.732 --> 39:21.359
Don't wander around.

39:21.442 --> 39:23.361
The man on the 2nd floor
is out to get you.

39:23.444 --> 39:25.905
But he won't come up here
to the 15th floor.

39:25.988 --> 39:27.656
This place is too far away.

39:28.866 --> 39:30.242
Thank you.

39:30.326 --> 39:32.787
I'll stay here only until Mr. Kim returns.

39:32.870 --> 39:34.246
Well, if he does return.

39:35.331 --> 39:36.415
Get some rest.

39:37.124 --> 39:39.710
And take those goggles off
when you're alone.

39:39.794 --> 39:41.337
It's uncomfortable, isn't it?

39:48.219 --> 39:50.054
Try to stay inside.

40:40.521 --> 40:41.564
Seo-yoon.

40:42.189 --> 40:43.399
Seo-yoon.

40:43.482 --> 40:45.234
Seo-yoon, what's wrong?

40:45.317 --> 40:47.278
Do you have chest pain?

40:49.905 --> 40:50.948
What's wrong?

40:55.494 --> 40:57.163
I just coughed.

40:58.831 --> 41:00.916
If I do this for a bit, it gets better.

41:02.585 --> 41:06.297
But why were you hiding like that?

41:07.381 --> 41:09.008
Don't you have medicine for it?

41:12.761 --> 41:15.139
I get a shot if I go to the hospital,

41:16.474 --> 41:18.058
but it hurts a lot.

41:20.186 --> 41:22.480
I just need to cough a bit.

41:36.452 --> 41:39.663
It'd be better to let Seo-yoon out, right?

41:40.789 --> 41:44.168
It may be dangerous,
but they have doctors and medicine.

41:44.251 --> 41:46.045
I'll talk to Han Tae-seok about it.

41:47.880 --> 41:49.173
Don't worry.

42:06.023 --> 42:07.399
I'm sure my husband

42:08.025 --> 42:10.986
would want me to do something
for this apartment too.

42:14.323 --> 42:16.825
He was worried about all of you
until his last moments.

42:18.744 --> 42:19.828
You all know…

42:21.789 --> 42:24.291
that the infected killed
the cleaning lady, right?

42:26.710 --> 42:29.171
They may still be inside,
so please be careful.

42:30.297 --> 42:32.550
Do your best to stay at home,

42:32.633 --> 42:36.428
and if you need to move,
stay in groups of two or more.

42:36.512 --> 42:39.306
We should discuss securing
the doors of this building

42:39.390 --> 42:41.934
and distinguishing
the infected from now on.

42:43.936 --> 42:45.229
In the case of my husband…

42:46.564 --> 42:48.357
If we had found out a bit earlier…

42:52.987 --> 42:57.658
It's important to actively find
the infected.

42:58.367 --> 43:00.411
And persuade those

43:00.494 --> 43:03.080
who are not coming out
of their houses to test them.

43:04.039 --> 43:05.082
Yes.

43:06.333 --> 43:08.168
Right, we have to find the infected.

43:09.169 --> 43:12.131
Whose blood should we use today?

43:14.008 --> 43:15.426
Should we draw straws?

43:16.135 --> 43:18.679
I think you should just do it.

43:20.723 --> 43:22.224
No.

43:22.308 --> 43:25.686
A doctor should do it.
So you can treat yourself when you bleed!

43:25.769 --> 43:26.812
Get away from me!

43:26.895 --> 43:28.188
Hey, stop!

43:28.772 --> 43:30.107
Don't do this!

43:30.190 --> 43:31.692
- Someone will get hurt!
- Stop it!

43:31.775 --> 43:33.694
Someone will get hurt for real!

43:47.082 --> 43:49.793
Stop this, will you?

43:51.462 --> 43:55.215
More than that,
shouldn't we discuss food and water first?

43:55.299 --> 43:57.384
If you have any ideas, please tell us.

43:57.968 --> 44:00.012
We're going outside.

44:00.095 --> 44:02.514
If Kim Se-hoon really did go outside,

44:02.598 --> 44:04.016
that means there's a way out.

44:04.099 --> 44:07.770
So we're going to go outside
and see if we can get food or water.

44:07.853 --> 44:10.939
There's emergency power
down in the basement.

44:11.023 --> 44:12.775
Rather than going outside,

44:12.858 --> 44:15.819
if you go down
and turn on that emergency power,

44:15.903 --> 44:18.197
the electricity will come back on,
so we can cook,

44:18.280 --> 44:19.907
and the water will start again too.

44:20.949 --> 44:22.034
Building 103 has EPS,

44:22.618 --> 44:23.786
Emergency Power Supply,

44:23.869 --> 44:25.871
in the electrical room
under the senior citizens' center.

44:27.081 --> 44:30.125
It's made to turn on
emergency lights for elevators.

44:30.209 --> 44:31.710
If you turn on the general power,

44:31.794 --> 44:33.754
the electricity and water
will be turned on.

44:33.837 --> 44:36.632
But honestly, I'm more worried that

44:37.424 --> 44:40.969
you could just go outside
and never return.

44:41.553 --> 44:43.389
Right, that's true.

44:44.390 --> 44:47.434
Mr. Detective,
you're close to that military man.

44:51.146 --> 44:54.942
Like Mr. Oh said, it'd be better
to take care of things here first.

45:03.742 --> 45:04.743
Let's do that.

45:05.494 --> 45:08.997
We'll go down and turn on
the emergency power.

45:17.506 --> 45:18.590
Mr. Oh.

45:20.175 --> 45:22.469
How did you know
about the emergency power?

45:22.553 --> 45:25.347
Anyone who lives
in an apartment knows that.

45:25.431 --> 45:27.057
I know you hate me,

45:27.141 --> 45:30.394
but this is a time of emergency.

45:30.477 --> 45:34.189
So take a look at things with
a broader point of view and cooperate.

45:34.273 --> 45:37.901
We should live
like civilized human beings.

45:41.447 --> 45:43.449
Are we really going
to the electrical room?

45:44.533 --> 45:48.203
It sounds a bit fishy, but it's necessary.

45:48.287 --> 45:49.913
That's true, but…

45:50.456 --> 45:52.332
It's a chance to let Seo-yoon out too.

45:53.667 --> 45:56.628
Let's send her out
before we go down to the electrical room.

45:57.838 --> 45:59.548
What should we tell her, though?

45:59.631 --> 46:01.133
We can keep that a secret.

46:02.468 --> 46:05.888
She may refuse if we say
that she's getting out alone.

46:07.139 --> 46:07.973
That's true.

46:08.682 --> 46:10.976
She's actually quite mature, so…

46:12.352 --> 46:16.273
Going down is one thing,
but how will we come up?

46:17.483 --> 46:20.569
Remember how he said
it's really noisy when it's turned on?

46:21.153 --> 46:24.114
The infected will rush toward us
when they hear the noise.

46:24.198 --> 46:26.158
And they'll chase us here.

46:26.241 --> 46:28.035
If the entrance is breached,

46:29.453 --> 46:31.205
it can get more dangerous.

46:31.288 --> 46:33.373
Then we can come up using a different way.

46:34.708 --> 46:35.751
Let's go.

46:46.470 --> 46:47.846
Get some more sleep.

48:02.504 --> 48:03.880
Get the infiltration team ready.

48:03.964 --> 48:06.049
If they don't call by morning,
we're going in.

48:06.133 --> 48:09.511
There are a lot of severe variant patients
in the apartment.

48:09.595 --> 48:13.265
If we go in without any arrangements,
there will be casualties.

48:13.765 --> 48:15.684
We just need Yoon Sae-bom safe.

48:15.767 --> 48:17.519
Lieutenant Colonel Han Tae-seok.

48:19.896 --> 48:20.897
Have you decided?

48:20.981 --> 48:22.524
I will let Sae-bom…

48:24.443 --> 48:25.485
and Seo-yoon out.

48:26.778 --> 48:30.032
They will be at the underground
parking lot at 1:00 p.m.,

48:30.115 --> 48:31.450
so get ready to take them.

48:31.533 --> 48:34.202
What about you? Aren't you coming?

48:35.621 --> 48:37.497
Someone has to stay and watch the house.

48:38.915 --> 48:40.876
We may have disagreed with one another,

48:40.959 --> 48:43.962
but I know that you sincerely
tried to stop Mad Human Disease.

48:47.299 --> 48:48.634
Please help us

48:49.968 --> 48:51.053
so Sae-bom

48:52.054 --> 48:54.014
and Seo-yoon can live safely.

49:02.439 --> 49:04.024
Jung Yi-hyun is infected.

49:05.067 --> 49:07.152
That's why he's trying
to let Yoon Sae-bom out.

49:49.736 --> 49:50.946
See?

49:53.615 --> 49:54.908
Let's play one more round.

49:55.784 --> 49:57.119
You want to play again?

49:57.661 --> 49:58.870
Until I win.

50:15.303 --> 50:16.930
- Yi-hyun.
- What?

50:17.013 --> 50:18.223
Let's talk for a minute.

50:26.356 --> 50:28.775
I talked to Han Tae-seok,

50:29.276 --> 50:32.195
and the soldiers are coming
to the underground parking lot.

50:32.779 --> 50:35.782
We can go down to the electrical room
after we send Seo-yoon out.

50:38.118 --> 50:39.870
You have eye boogers again.

50:45.083 --> 50:47.002
We talked about this already.

50:50.255 --> 50:52.591
We promised to tell each other
when we're sick.

50:53.759 --> 50:57.053
If I get infected, feel thirsty,
and want to bite people too,

50:57.137 --> 50:58.722
then I will make sure to tell you.

50:59.931 --> 51:00.807
So…

51:02.893 --> 51:04.978
you should also tell me
if anything happens.

51:05.645 --> 51:06.897
Are you okay?

51:10.400 --> 51:13.445
Of course, I'm okay. Why?

51:14.279 --> 51:16.406
Are you worried
my wound might be infected?

51:17.616 --> 51:19.075
I thought about it,

51:21.203 --> 51:24.706
and the wound
on your palm healed too quickly.

51:27.000 --> 51:28.752
You don't drink water, either.

51:31.671 --> 51:33.423
It does look much better, but…

51:34.257 --> 51:37.469
I told you. I'm a human vitamin
and a human antibiotic.

51:39.387 --> 51:43.099
It's not like that.
It still sores like crazy.

51:43.183 --> 51:44.601
I'll show you.

51:44.684 --> 51:45.977
Look.

51:47.771 --> 51:50.482
I was shocked seeing Lee Deok-soon's body,

51:50.565 --> 51:52.692
so I must've not known
that it burst again.

51:56.446 --> 51:57.489
Thank goodness.

51:58.573 --> 52:00.659
I was worried sick, you know.

52:01.451 --> 52:04.037
Then you should've told me.
Why were you worried?

52:04.120 --> 52:06.206
How can I not be worried? We have no cure.

52:08.583 --> 52:10.418
What if the wound gets infected?

52:10.502 --> 52:11.837
I told you to be careful.

52:13.588 --> 52:16.299
Okay, I'll be careful from now on.

52:20.971 --> 52:21.847
Hey.

52:26.601 --> 52:29.563
Lieutenant Colonel Han,
I know you're there.

52:30.146 --> 52:34.150
Prepare lots of antibiotics,
disinfectants, and bandages.

52:37.237 --> 52:38.947
Yi-hyun is injured.

52:40.031 --> 52:41.199
We will prepare them.

52:44.035 --> 52:45.996
I'm so glad to hear your voice.

52:46.580 --> 52:47.831
What about Kim Se-hoon?

52:48.665 --> 52:50.959
You have to be careful.
He may be infected.

52:52.002 --> 52:53.628
Kim Se-hoon isn't outside.

52:53.712 --> 52:56.840
He may still be there, so be careful.

52:57.507 --> 52:58.967
Once he tastes human blood,

53:00.427 --> 53:02.387
he'll continue to target and hunt people.

53:03.221 --> 53:04.389
Thank you.

53:06.892 --> 53:09.394
Let's look for Kim Se-hoon again.

53:12.647 --> 53:13.690
Sure.

53:20.989 --> 53:23.241
Mr. Kim, don't open the door
for just anyone.

53:23.325 --> 53:26.578
Kim Se-hoon may still be inside.

53:26.661 --> 53:28.163
Okay, don't worry.

53:28.246 --> 53:29.623
I have my gun.

53:30.415 --> 53:31.541
- We'll be back.
- Okay.

53:38.882 --> 53:42.052
Kim Se-hoon may still be here.

53:43.053 --> 53:48.725
People can even make bunkers.
He may have a secret space in his house.

53:48.808 --> 53:50.727
But even so…

53:50.810 --> 53:52.604
He may be hiding in here.

53:53.480 --> 53:55.774
We don't even know
the structure of this place.

53:57.525 --> 53:58.443
Andrew.

54:24.135 --> 54:27.514
Why don't we investigate
after letting Seo-yoon out?

54:28.515 --> 54:30.100
What if someone gets hurt again?

54:33.228 --> 54:36.439
I'll go down and look for Andrew.
You look around here.

54:37.023 --> 54:38.024
Okay.

54:49.369 --> 54:51.496
Ms. Yoon, can you hear me?

54:54.457 --> 54:57.377
First Lieutenant, I'm happy
to hear from you, but…

54:58.586 --> 55:00.046
I'm a bit busy right now.

55:00.130 --> 55:02.132
Ms. Yoon, this is something important.

55:02.215 --> 55:05.885
We got the background check results
for those in the apartment,

55:05.969 --> 55:07.387
and something's weird.

55:50.430 --> 55:54.017
Ahn Kook-jin was found dead in his house.

55:58.938 --> 56:00.982
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD: AHN KOOK-JIN

56:01.066 --> 56:02.567
I erased it.

56:06.571 --> 56:09.574
Administrative work is on hold
due to Mad Human Disease.

56:09.657 --> 56:12.285
It took a while
for the report to reach us.

56:16.206 --> 56:17.415
What about his face?

56:20.335 --> 56:21.419
Does he have scars?

56:43.858 --> 56:46.069
No, not at all.

56:51.616 --> 56:52.700
Are you in danger?

56:58.206 --> 57:00.125
It'll take four to five hours
to get there,

57:00.208 --> 57:01.584
so wait at your house.

57:01.668 --> 57:03.294
We'll go and take care of things.

57:09.425 --> 57:11.094
Ms. Yoon, are you listening?

57:17.976 --> 57:20.645
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD: KIM SE-HOON

57:37.954 --> 57:41.207
LEE DEOK-SOON

57:55.138 --> 57:56.598
I found…

57:58.016 --> 57:59.434
Kim Se-hoon.

58:02.145 --> 58:03.229
Wait.

58:03.855 --> 58:06.566
Take your time. Relax, okay?

58:10.778 --> 58:11.613
What is it?

58:11.696 --> 58:14.908
I saw Kim Se-hoon.
Open the door. He may come after me.

58:20.038 --> 58:21.706
Wait, did he get the disease?

58:31.799 --> 58:33.676
I'll tell you if I need help,
so wait there.

58:49.776 --> 58:52.403
What are you doing? It's your turn.

59:15.635 --> 59:17.428
What do you think you're doing?

59:20.765 --> 59:22.141
My husband…

59:24.143 --> 59:26.104
died because of you two.

59:51.004 --> 59:52.422
Jung-kook!

59:52.505 --> 59:53.673
Jung-kook!

59:53.756 --> 59:55.049
Jung-kook! Wake up!

59:55.133 --> 59:56.718
It's me. I'm here.

01:00:12.191 --> 01:00:13.484
Who are you?

01:00:59.530 --> 01:01:01.866
I have an offer for you.

01:01:01.949 --> 01:01:05.411
There's a way
to get rid of those we don't like.

01:01:05.495 --> 01:01:06.537
I know who you are.

01:01:06.621 --> 01:01:08.164
Go turn the electricity on.

01:01:08.247 --> 01:01:10.750
Then I will let Seo-yoon
and that detective out.

01:01:12.251 --> 01:01:13.795
The infected will swarm in!

01:01:15.463 --> 01:01:20.343
We will get out of here alive,
and we will arrest all of them.

01:01:20.426 --> 01:01:23.554
Block it again after Ms. Yoon comes out.
Jung Yi-hyun is infected.

01:01:24.472 --> 01:01:25.890
Tell them to fire.

01:01:29.644 --> 01:01:34.649
Subtitle translation by: Hae-lim Lee
